/*
 * Implements validation for list and tuple pattern matching in Ymir.
 *
 * List/tuple patterns allow destructuring of structured values inside match
 * expressions:
 *
 *     (x, y) = value
 *     (head, tail...) = value
 *     [a, b] = array
 *     [first, rest...] = slice
 *
 * 
 * <hr>
 * 
 * @Package: ymirc        
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::value::control::match_::list
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/value/control/match_/list.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created (YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-04-09
 * @Copyright (C) 2021–2026 GNU-Ymir
 * @License
 *   ```text
